WEBVTT

00:02:28.065 --> 00:02:31.955
how long before we can actually 
teleport you through a device like this,

00:02:31.955 --> 00:02:33.165
right in the midst here?

00:02:33.165 --> 00:02:36.365
Because, like people are screaming
in your office for me,

00:02:36.365 --> 00:02:38.065
they are screaming here for you.

00:02:38.065 --> 00:02:43.195
(Applause)

00:02:46.665 --> 00:02:52.025
I think it's still a few years away
but we are all working really hard on it.

00:02:52.794 --> 00:02:57.794
Hopefully in the next five to ten years,
we can make it much much better.

00:02:57.794 --> 00:03:00.204
SRK: Ok. You have to promise,
when you crack this